    {
      "source": "<span class=\"deprecated-label\">Deprecated, for removal: This API element is subject to removal in a future version.</span>",
      "translation": "<code class=\"deprecated-label\">已弃用，即将移除：此 API 元素将在未来版本中被移除。</code>",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "Gets the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> for the given, required <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>named bean</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取给定且必需的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a>，该定义对应于指定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>named bean</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Gets the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/RootBeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>RootBeanDefinition</code></a> for the given, required <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>bean name</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取给定且必需的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/RootBeanDefinition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory.support 中的类或接口\"><code>RootBeanDefinition</code></a>，其对应的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>bean name</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determines whether a bean identified by the given, required <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>name</code></a> is a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a>.",
      "translation": "确定由给定的必需 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>name</code></a> 标识的 Bean 是否为\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory 中的类或接口\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>bean's</code></a> defined <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a>.",
      "translation": "解析了由<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>bean</code></a>定义的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determines whether a bean definition identified by the given, required <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>name</code></a> is present.",
      "translation": "确定是否存在由给定的必需 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>name</code></a> 标识的 Bean 定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/NoSuchBeanDefinitionException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">NoSuchBeanDefinitionException</a></code> - if a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> cannot be found for the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>named\n          bean</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/NoSuchBeanDefinitionException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">NoSuchBeanDefinitionException</a></code> - 如果找不到 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> 对应的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>命名 Bean</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
