    {
      "source": "since 4.0 as this isn't widely used and can be easily implemented within user code.",
      "translation": "自 4.0 版本起，由于该功能使用不广泛且易于在用户代码中实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Interface defining introspection methods for bean definitions.",
      "translation": "定义用于 Bean 定义的自省方法的接口。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "true if the bean identified by the given, required <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>name</code></a> is a\n        <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果由给定的必需 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>name</code></a> 标识的 Bean 是\n        <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory 中的类或接口\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a>，则为 true。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
