    {
      "source": "true if the bean definition identified by the given, required <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>name</code></a> registered\n        with.",
